            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea la constante para usar dentro de la función.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lampStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" power = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Powered On: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + power);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lampStatus();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Powered On: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>const</code> seguido de <code>power</code> y luego <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro de <code>lampStatus</code>, declara una constante booleana que haga que su salida termine en <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lampStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" power = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Powered On: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + power);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lampStatus();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Powered On: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>const</code> seguido de <code>power</code>, <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
